---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
const updated = 'October 26, 2026';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Legal" updated={updated} description={`How ${SITE.name} collects, uses and protects information when you visit ${SITE.url.replace('https://', '')}.`}>
	<p>
		This Privacy Policy explains what information {SITE.name} ("we", "us") collects when you visit {SITE.url} (the "Site"), how
		we use it, and the choices you have.
	</p>

	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and anything you include in your message. We use it only to reply to you.</p>
	<p>
		<strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, the Site and the services it uses may collect
		technical information such as your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, referring website and the time of
		your visit. This is collected through cookies, web beacons and similar technologies.
	</p>

	<h2>Cookies</h2>
	<p>
		Cookies are small files stored on your device. We and our partners use them to keep the Site working, understand how it is
		used, and show advertising. You can control or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking some cookies may affect how
		the Site works.
	</p>

	<h2>Advertising and Google AdSense</h2>
	<p>We use Google AdSense to show ads on the Site.</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Third party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this Site or other websites.</li>
		<li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this Site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
		<li>
			You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
			You can also opt out of some third party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at
			<a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			To learn more, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland will be asked for consent before personalized ads
		are shown, through a Google certified consent message.
	</p>

	<h2>Analytics</h2>
	<p>
		We may use analytics services such as Google Analytics or Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand how visitors use the Site.
		These services collect information about your visit in aggregate form to help us improve our content.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
	<p>
		Some links on the Site are affiliate links. When you click one, the company you visit may use cookies to record that you came
		from our Site. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.
	</p>

	<h2>How we use information</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>To operate, maintain and improve the Site</li>
		<li>To respond to your messages</li>
		<li>To show advertising that helps keep the Site free</li>
		<li>To protect the Site against fraud and abuse</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>
		Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in the EU and UK, or state privacy laws such as the CCPA in
		California), you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal information we hold about you, or to object to
		certain uses. To make a request, email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Children's privacy</h2>
	<p>The Site is intended for adults running or working in businesses. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

	<h2>Third party websites</h2>
	<p>The Site links to other websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please read their policies.</p>

	<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
	<p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
